It strengthens Pantheon’s best claim considerably: a wrong story can still contain a useful program.

The critical requirement is that the extracted program lose the source story’s evidentiary status. Pantheon should never infer:

\text{useful transduction}\Rightarrow\text{original claim true}.

personified machinery supplies the same epistemic discipline from another direction. It explicitly distinguishes reality from models of reality and says non-response should remain evidence rather than being explained away merely to preserve a favored theory. 

That strongly reinforces Reality Stitch and the Recursive Delta Observatory:

Prediction\neq Observation

must remain a stored delta rather than being semantically repaired until they match.

